            "line": 603,
            "text": "theorem exists_profileFamily {h j σ : ℝ} {P0 : ℝ → ℝ}\n    (d : AnalyticInputs h j σ P0) (hsmall : NaturalAxisRange.Parameters h j)\n    (hσ : 0 < σ) (hP0 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ P0) :\n    ∃ Λ₀ : ℝ, 0 < Λ₀ ∧ ∀ Λ : ℝ, Λ₀ ≤ Λ →\n      ∀ C : ℝ, d.normalizationThreshold Λ ≤ C → Nonempty (ProfileFamily d Λ C)"
